{{- /*
Shared documentation prompt partials. Every documentation prompt template — the
default and each Template override — is parsed together with this file, so it
may call any partial below with {{ template "<name>" . }}. Each partial holds
exactly the text the templates repeated before it existed; the call sites keep
the original whitespace trimming, so the rendered prompt (and promptSha256) is
unchanged. Nothing outside a define block is ever rendered.
*/ -}}

